  "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the elliptic cone, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{0}^{2}}{8}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =(z-4)^{2} \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{2} & =(z-4)^{2} \\\\ \\pm \\frac{y}{2} & =z-4 \\\\ z & =\\pm \\frac{y}{2}+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us two lines in the $yz$-plane with equations $z=\\pm \\frac{y}{2}+4.$",
